scenario: RADIO-EAR-02
title: Radio search
area: Radio
rows: F-RADIO-13
machines: any
needs: person
prereq: Internet connection and working speakers.
step: Open RADIO, press / (or the Search button) and type a word such as jazz.
expect: A list of stations from the directory appears under the box.
clause: search
step: Choose one of the results.
expect: It plays through the speakers.
clause: play
step: Search for a word no station has (for example xqzvw).
expect: The screen says nothing was found, with no error text.
clause: none
